# Title: Original built-in sequences
# The table shipped by the extension up to version 2.0 (upstream commit
# 70279b8), converted unchanged. Highest priority: nothing imported later may
# change what these sequences produce. test/table.test.js checks every entry
# against test/fixtures/builtin-2.0.js.
# Licence: Apache-2.0 (the extension's own).

